WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:04.125
A task can change meaning when its condition disappears.

00:00:04.445 --> 00:00:12.019
Loose Ends turns notes into editable action drafts, keeping the original source beside each one for review.

00:00:14.350 --> 00:00:19.247
Here’s a staged, synthetic project handoff with Priya, Leo and Mina.

00:00:19.567 --> 00:00:24.539
Paste it into Your notes, keeping each action and its condition on one line.

00:00:27.350 --> 00:00:30.387
Under Process with, choose This Mac, local.

00:00:30.707 --> 00:00:34.611
Once Local model ready appears, select Find actions.

00:00:34.931 --> 00:00:38.069
This example uses the local Qwen model.

00:00:46.350 --> 00:00:51.397
This recorded run produced three drafts; the checks left one suggestion out.

00:00:51.717 --> 00:00:55.801
Check Owner and Due: Priya has Friday, and Leo has tomorrow.

00:00:56.121 --> 00:00:58.152
Relative dates stay as written.

00:01:01.350 --> 00:01:06.685
Mina’s source says, “If the review passes, Mina will archive the old checklist.”

00:01:07.005 --> 00:01:09.815
Archiving depends on that review passing.

00:01:10.135 --> 00:01:13.975
The complete line stays visible with the condition and source.

00:01:18.350 --> 00:01:24.697
To clarify Priya’s draft, select Edit and change Action to “Send the draft to the project team.”

00:01:25.017 --> 00:01:26.339
Save changes.

00:01:26.659 --> 00:01:32.045
“Edited by you” identifies your addition; the original quote stays attached.

00:01:36.350 --> 00:01:41.155
For this demonstration, mark Priya’s task done, then select Export.

00:01:41.475 --> 00:01:45.316
The Markdown keeps completion, edits and source evidence.

00:01:45.636 --> 00:01:47.891
Export before closing the tab.

00:01:50.350 --> 00:01:52.296
Hosted Groq is optional.

00:01:52.616 --> 00:02:00.072
Selecting Find actions there sends the complete submitted text to Groq and may use paid API credit.

00:02:02.350 --> 00:02:10.086
Review is still essential: a longer meeting test using hosted processing missed a conditional commitment.

00:02:10.406 --> 00:02:14.747
A matching quote doesn’t prove every action is correct or present.

00:02:16.350 --> 00:02:22.717
Loose Ends is an MIT-licensed app using open-weight models under their own licenses.

00:02:23.037 --> 00:02:26.082
Explore the source and setup guide on GitHub.
